---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

export const prerender = false;
---

<Base title="Mission debrief" description="A curious crawler's classified debrief." noindex>
  <article class="wrap debrief">
    <header class="mission-header">
      <p class="mono eyebrow">CURIOUS CRAWLER / CLASSIFIED MISSION DEBRIEF</p>
      <h1 class="serif">Mission complete.</h1>
      <p class="intro">Congratulations, curious crawler. You followed the signal, looked closer, and earned your clearance.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="report">
      <figure class="portrait">
        <img src="/transmissions/mascot.png" width="1080" height="1920" alt="A geometric portrait of a duck secret agent wearing a hat and sunglasses, carrying a briefcase." />
        <figcaption class="mono">CLASSIFIED MASCOT / AGENT QUACK</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="details">
        <section class="award">
          <p class="mono label">AWARD</p>
          <h2 class="serif">Certified Curiosity Compiler</h2>
          <p>Valid in all known contexts. Non-transferable to uninterested robots.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="expenses">
          <p class="mono label">EXPENSE REPORT / ENTIRELY FICTIONAL</p>
          <dl>
            <div><dt>Curiosity</dt><dd>1 unit</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Packets reassembled</dt><dd>3</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Actual credits measured</dt><dd>None</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Satisfaction</dt><dd>Hopefully considerable</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </section>

        <section class="joke">
          <p class="mono label">FINAL TRANSMISSION</p>
          <p>Knock knock.<br />Who's there?<br />Token.<br />Token who?</p>
          <p class="punchline serif">Token a detour just to spend credits on a knock-knock joke.</p>
          <p>Thank you for playing. You clearly have excellent taste in rabbit holes.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .debrief { padding-block: var(--space-section); }
  .mission-header { max-width: 46rem; margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); }
  .eyebrow, .label, figcaption { color: var(--support); font-size: var(--text-meta); }
  .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
  h1 { font-size: var(--text-display); margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .intro { max-width: 48ch; color: var(--ink-muted); line-height: 1.7; }
  .report { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem); align-items: start; }
  .portrait { margin: 0; }
  .portrait img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  figcaption { margin-top: 0.8rem; }
  .details { max-width: 34rem; }
  .details section + section { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: 2.4rem; padding-top: 2.4rem; }
  .label { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  h2 { font-size: var(--text-title); margin: 0 0 0.8rem; }
  .details p:not(.label) { color: var(--ink-muted); line-height: 1.7; }
  dl { margin: 0; }
  dl div { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 0.4rem 1rem; padding: 0.65rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  dt { color: var(--ink-muted); }
  dd { margin: 0; color: var(--ink); text-align: right; }
  .details .punchline { color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.2rem; margin-block: 1rem; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .report { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .portrait { max-width: 28rem; }
  }
</style>
